{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Garenburg Penitence: Elucidate\u00a0</i>is an artbook for <i>Garenburg Penitence: The Riflebird</i>. A look into the creation of a tragedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The following artbook contains:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 200 pages of stuff to see and look at</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original and previously unreleased artwork and renders for the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean renditions of levels and their artwork, as well as their GREEN Mode variants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Gallery artwork with information about their designs and creation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A solemn thank you for your time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find the artbook, please open the game files folder.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Steam, go to the &quot;Library&quot; tab</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locate <i>Garenburg Penitence: The Riflebird</i> in your library</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right click the game, and select the &quot;Properties&quot; tab</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select the &quot;Local Files&quot; tab and click on the &quot;Browse Local Files&quot; button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The artbook will be Elucidate.pdf. Open with anything that can open the pdf file format.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3887810?t=1759393016","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3887810?t=1759393016","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887810/f3dd123fd73e168239135b8a79f28e42958c7445/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759393016","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887810/f3dd123fd73e168239135b8a